# Keep Maven's reactor parallel; the OpenAPI plugin guards swagger-core registry
# initialization before registering each module's configured converter list.
-T1C
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.serviceUnavailable=429,502,503,504
# A reactor thread holds the resolver's artifact locks for its whole dependency
# batch while it downloads, including through the retry backoff above. The
# default lock wait (30 s, retried once) is shorter than one slow transfer, so
# modules needing only already-local artifacts failed with "Could not acquire
# lock(s)" while the holder was still succeeding (holds of ~16 min observed).
# Wait up to 30 min in a single attempt: well above those holds, and short
# enough that a real lock failure still surfaces before the CI job timeout.
-Daether.syncContext.named.time=1800
-Daether.syncContext.named.retry=0
